  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This dataset contains Copernicus EMS Rapid Mapping products for activation EMSR927. On the 26 August 2026, a flash flood reportedly triggered by a Glacial Lake Outburst Flood (GLOF) in Nepal has caused significant damage in Rasuwa District. There is a 7 m-deep water level recorded by monitoring stations. Copernicus EMS Rapid Mapping is requested to provide flood extent and damage assessment emergency mapping. GDACS ID: FL1104124. **Citation:** Copernicus Emergency Management Service (© 2026 European Union), EMSR927 **Product types present in this dataset's resources:** **GRA (Grading)**: assesses damage to individual features (eg. buildings, infrastructure). Where a GeoPackage download is available for an Area of Interest/round, it already contains every layer with its official Copernicus styling and colours - prefer it in GIS software over the zipped shapefile download."
  ],
